## chart main DogSwipe Delivery Stack
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  user["iOS user"]
  ios["SwiftUI app"]
  vm["View models"]
  core["DogSwipeCore package"]
  client["DogSwipeAPIClient"]
  profiles["HotdogProfile contract"]
  preferences["CravingPreferences contract"]
  api["FastAPI backend"]
  principal["Principal resolver"]
  migrations["Alembic migrations"]
  db["PostgreSQL"]
  spaps["SPAPS auth"]
  gates["Quality Gates"]

  user --> ios
  ios --> vm
  vm --> core
  vm --> client
  core --> profiles
  core --> preferences
  client --> api
  api --> profiles
  api --> preferences
  api --> principal
  principal --> spaps
  api --> db
  migrations --> db
  core --> gates
  api --> gates
  migrations --> gates

  gates["Quality Gates"]
  spaps["SPAPS Boundary"]
```

## chart quality Quality Gates
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SwiftTests
  SwiftTests --> BackendCoverage
  BackendCoverage --> DriftScan
  DriftScan --> CrapScore
  CrapScore --> DeployPreflight
  DeployPreflight --> [*]
```

## chart spaps SPAPS Boundary
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as iOS App
  participant API as DogSwipe API
  participant SPAPS as Sweet Potato/SPAPS
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  App->>API: Authorization: Bearer JWT
  API->>SPAPS: Validate user/session
  SPAPS-->>API: AuthenticatedUser.user_id
  API->>DB: Read hotdog profiles, swipes, or preferences
  API-->>App: Hotdog discovery, match, or preference response
```
